tps://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T12:37:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T12:37:57Z","body":"once you can rebuild from the editor you could tab out change the name tab in rebuild and now it is loading again. Or on the other side you might already have modified the name and it didn't load specifically because of that you change it from the ui and it reloads fine\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3920604038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4155224610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115846#issuecomment-4155224610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115846","id":4155224610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73q7Ii","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-30T13:53:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T13:53:38Z","body":"I still don't understand what the use-case of an editor for a file is where all you can do with the file is break it.\r\nI'd love to give my approval as well, but this concern still hasn't been addressed yet.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4155224610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4166209764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115846#issuecomment-4166209764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115846","id":4166209764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74U1Dk","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T23:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T13:51:04Z","body":"We discussed this at today's GDExtension meeting and there were some really great points raised. This is definitely a feature that people have asked for repeatedly, usually in the context of \"we had this in GDNative, and I want it for GDExtension too,\" but also new users saying that editing the .gdextension file is a pain point when creating their first extension.\r\n\r\nHowever, this feature only makes sense for people creating a GDExtension, and not developers only using GDExtensions, and this would make it very easy for those developers to inadvertently break things (and it was brought up that ~19% of folks still don't use version control [per the last poll](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScKWGJoLEeNW1qrsDfZRfk7gHultapacH5ZhQmo9XRZADW1IQ/viewanalytics)). This argument, in particular, has kind of won me over to this line of thinking.\r\n\r\nIt was also brought up that this doesn't make all fields of the .gdextension file editable, so if you were creating a GDExtension, you'd still need to edit this file in a text editor anyway. We could commit to making all fields editable, but this is more work and on-going maintenance.\r\n\r\nOn https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90979 there was a lot of support for having the developer tools for creating a new GDExtension be an addon, and so this editing functionality could also be a part of that?\r\n\r\nThat said, there was a lot of support for having the list of GDExtensions in the editor in the Project Settings dialog, and the ability to _view_ some information from the .gdextension files - just not for editing it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4166209764/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4168424446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115846#issuecomment-4168424446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115846","id":4168424446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74dRv-","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T08:29:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T08:29:50Z","body":"I think it might make sense to move the interesting information out of the popup - min version, max version only I think - and just delete the popup for now.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4168424446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4168803103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115846#issuecomment-4168803103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115846","id":4168803103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74euMf","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T09:35:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T09:35:16Z","body":"@dsnopek @Ivorforce Ok, but since that is considerably different, I've opened a new PR: #118063.\r\n\r\nAfter PR #118063 is merged I can rebase this one, we'll probably close this PR anyway but at least then the branch will be available for reference in a more up-to-date form.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4168803103/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4177919056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115846#issuecomment-4177919056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115846","id":4177919056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75BfxQ","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T13:34:24Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T13:34:59Z","body":"> However, this feature only makes sense for people creating a GDExtension, and not developers only using GDExtensions, and this would make it very easy for those developers to inadvertently break things (and it was brought up that ~19% of folks still don't use version control [per the last poll](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScKWGJoLEeNW1qrsDfZRfk7gHultapacH5ZhQmo9XRZADW1IQ/viewanalytics)). This argument, in particular, has kind of won me over to this line of thinking.\r\n\r\nOn the counter part of that is you can already butcher a plugin easily through the file system by deleting the wrong file and the solution to that is simply to re-download the plugin, you don't really need version control to prevent those issue. I feel like people know they shouldn't mess too much with things that they have imprted and when they do so I would expect to at least know that if something is wrong they should just re-download it.\r\nOn the other side if we really want to make it so people can't shoot themself in the foot we can add a new parameter called locked that default to false and when it is true you cannot edit it from this interface and are asked to edit it through a text editor or at least to click on a button saying yeah I know I'm most likely going to shoot myself in the foot.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4177919056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]